      "message": "Agreed with Jiakai on all counts here. Generally we\u0027d need much more concrete security / privacy review of changes like this to critical logging.\n\nEven if we assumed all of this data is \"essential\" as described in the description and we could get it all approved, I think we\u0027ll need to do a better job plumbing it down to the ActivityMetricsLogger vs. just querying for it all on demand as is being done in this CL.\n\nIf you feel there is need to merge this into AOSP, please file a bug with justification for all of the additional data so we can align and kick off necessary design and reviews.",
